window.SITE_SEARCH = [["page","/about/","About LyKinda and Our Family Story","The story behind Queen E's Heirr: small-batch jams and pickles made by hand in Slidell, Louisiana, from recipes passed down through four generations. Meet founder LyKinda Thibodeaux.","Born From Passion, Preserved for Generations LyKinda Thibodeaux Navigate Any Social Situation With Grace Ready to Unlock Your Social Potential? A Black Woman-Owned, Family-Owned Small Business Quality Products Every Time From One Jar to a Whole Pantry Essie and Queen Esther A Jar at a Produce Stand Jams, Pickles and Classes The Heart and Soul of Queen E's Small Batch, Fresh Fruit, Southern Flavor More Than Jam Questions People Ask Taste the Tradition"],["faq","/about/","How do you say \"Queen E's\"?","\"Queenie's.\" The name began as \"Queen Essie's,\" in honor of LyKinda's grandmother, Essie, and her mother, Queen Esther.","\"Queenie's.\" The name began as \"Queen Essie's,\" in honor of LyKinda's grandmother, Essie, and her mother, Queen Esther."],["faq","/about/","Where is Queen E's Heirr based?","Slidell, Louisiana, on the Northshore of Lake Pontchartrain in St. Tammany Parish. The jars ship across the United States and are sold at events, pop-ups and in store at Bayou Stuf in Lacombe.","Slidell, Louisiana, on the Northshore of Lake Pontchartrain in St. Tammany Parish. The jars ship across the United States and are sold at events, pop-ups and in store at Bayou Stuf in Lacombe."],["faq","/about/","Who makes the jams?","LyKinda Thibodeaux makes them by hand, in small batches, with help from her family.","LyKinda Thibodeaux makes them by hand, in small batches, with help from her family."],["faq","/about/","Is the jam really handmade?","Yes. Every jar is cooked by hand in small batches from family recipes. That is why some flavors sell out and why others return only when the fruit is in season.","Yes. Every jar is cooked by hand in small batches from family recipes. That is why some flavors sell out and why others return only when the fruit is in season."],["page","/classes/","Jam Making & Etiquette","Hands-on jam making and etiquette classes with a STEM lab, for students and groups. Register with Queen E's Heirr.","Jam Making & Etiquette Classes What We Teach Standalone Jam Making & STEM Lab Jam Making & Etiquette Combined Upcoming Classes Hosted by Queen E's Heirr Want a Class Just for Your Group? Request a Quote"],["page","/deals/","Deals and Promo Codes","Current sales and promo codes at Queen E\\'s Heirr, small-batch jams and pickled goods from Slidell, Louisiana.","Deals & Promo Codes"],["page","/education/","Leadership Programs for TRIO, GEAR UP and Schools","Student leadership curriculum, workshops and keynotes for TRIO, GEAR UP, Upward Bound, college-access programs, schools and youth organizations nationwide. The J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Model from Queen E's Heirr.","Student Leadership Programs That Meet Your Students Where They Are Choose What Fits Your Group J.U.D.A.H. for Students Student Leadership Academy Youth Dining & Social Graces Support for Program Staff and Advisors Who We Serve How to Get Started Questions Educators Ask Help Your Students Lead With Confidence"],["faq","/education/","What leadership programs does Queen E's Heirr offer for TRIO, GEAR UP and other college-access programs?","Queen E's Heirr offers J.U.D.A.H. for Students, a student leadership curriculum, along with the Student Leadership Academy and Youth Dining & Social Graces. A J.U.D.A.H. leadership keynote is also available for students,","Queen E's Heirr offers J.U.D.A.H. for Students, a student leadership curriculum, along with the Student Leadership Academy and Youth Dining & Social Graces. A J.U.D.A.H. leadership keynote is also available for students, staff and conferences. Programs can be tailored to your group, so tell us about your students and goals."],["faq","/education/","Do you serve programs outside Louisiana?","Yes. Queen E's Heirr serves schools and organizations nationwide. Tell us where your group is and how you would like to meet, and we will plan it with you.","Yes. Queen E's Heirr serves schools and organizations nationwide. Tell us where your group is and how you would like to meet, and we will plan it with you."],["faq","/education/","Who leads the sessions?","Sessions are led by LyKinda Thibodeaux, the author of the J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Model, and Queen E's facilitators.","Sessions are led by LyKinda Thibodeaux, the author of the J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Model, and Queen E's facilitators."],["faq","/education/","What age groups do you work with?","Youth Dining & Social Graces is designed for ages 8 to 17. The Student Leadership Academy and J.U.D.A.H. for Students serve students, and the professional curriculum serves the staff and leaders who guide them. Ask us wh","Youth Dining & Social Graces is designed for ages 8 to 17. The Student Leadership Academy and J.U.D.A.H. for Students serve students, and the professional curriculum serves the staff and leaders who guide them. Ask us which fits your group."],["faq","/education/","Can you speak to our staff or at our conference?","Yes. The J.U.D.A.H. Leadership keynote presents the curriculum as a talk for schools, programs and organizations, and the professional edition supports the staff who lead student programs.","Yes. The J.U.D.A.H. Leadership keynote presents the curriculum as a talk for schools, programs and organizations, and the professional edition supports the staff who lead student programs."],["faq","/education/","How do we get started?","Use the Ask About a Program form on the Etiquette & Leadership page. Share your program, student group, goals and timing, and we will recommend a fit.","Use the Ask About a Program form on the Etiquette & Leadership page. Share your program, student group, goals and timing, and we will recommend a fit."],["page","/faq/","FAQ","Answers about ordering, shipping, classes, and wholesale at Queen E's Heirr.","Good Things to Know Join the Mailing List"],["faq","/faq/","Are the jams small batch?","Yes. LyKinda makes them in small batches from family recipes, with fresh fruit and ingredients that are mostly local.","Yes. LyKinda makes them in small batches from family recipes, with fresh fruit and ingredients that are mostly local."],["faq","/faq/","Where is Queen E's Heirr made?","Queen E's Heirr jams and pickled goods are made by hand in Slidell, Louisiana, on the Northshore of Lake Pontchartrain, and are sold online, at events and pop-ups, and in store at Bayou Stuf in Lacombe, Louisiana.","Queen E's Heirr jams and pickled goods are made by hand in Slidell, Louisiana, on the Northshore of Lake Pontchartrain, and are sold online, at events and pop-ups, and in store at Bayou Stuf in Lacombe, Louisiana."],["faq","/faq/","Is Queen E's an artisan or handmade jam?","Yes. Every jar is cooked in small batches by hand from family recipes, using fresh fruit and ingredients sourced as close to home as possible. Flavors change with the seasons, so jars are made when the fruit is at its be","Yes. Every jar is cooked in small batches by hand from family recipes, using fresh fruit and ingredients sourced as close to home as possible. Flavors change with the seasons, so jars are made when the fruit is at its best rather than on a factory schedule."],["faq","/faq/","Is Queen E's Heirr a Black woman-owned small business?","Yes. Queen E's Heirr is a Black woman-owned, family-owned small business in Slidell, Louisiana, founded in 2022 by LyKinda Thibodeaux. Every jar is made by hand in small batches.","Yes. Queen E's Heirr is a Black woman-owned, family-owned small business in Slidell, Louisiana, founded in 2022 by LyKinda Thibodeaux. Every jar is made by hand in small batches."],["faq","/faq/","What makes Queen E's different from store-bought jam?","Queen E's is made in small batches with fresh seasonal fruit. The flavors lean Southern and Louisiana-inspired, including peppered jam, jalapeño pepper jam, pineapple mango pepper jam and blueberry ginger, alongside clas","Queen E's is made in small batches with fresh seasonal fruit. The flavors lean Southern and Louisiana-inspired, including peppered jam, jalapeño pepper jam, pineapple mango pepper jam and blueberry ginger, alongside classics like strawberry, peach and blackberry. Many jars pair with cheese, charcuterie and grilling as well as toast."],["faq","/faq/","What are the best Queen E's jams for a charcuterie board or gift?","Peppered Jam, Blueberry Peppered Jam, Pineapple Mango Pepper Jam and Jalapeño Pepper Jam are favorites for cheese and charcuterie boards. Peach, Raspberry and Strawberry Mango make easy, crowd-pleasing gifts. Pickled goo","Peppered Jam, Blueberry Peppered Jam, Pineapple Mango Pepper Jam and Jalapeño Pepper Jam are favorites for cheese and charcuterie boards. Peach, Raspberry and Strawberry Mango make easy, crowd-pleasing gifts. Pickled goods such as Poppin Sweet Peppers and the dill and tart pickles round out a board."],["faq","/faq/","Are all flavors available year-round?","Most of our flavors are seasonal and may not be available year-round. Queen E's provides the freshest ingredients possible, so some flavors are only made when the fruit is in season. If a flavor is sold out, check back s","Most of our flavors are seasonal and may not be available year-round. Queen E's provides the freshest ingredients possible, so some flavors are only made when the fruit is in season. If a flavor is sold out, check back soon or join the mailing list to hear when it returns."],["faq","/faq/","What sizes do the jars come in?","Jams come in Regular (8 oz) and Large (12 oz), plus a 4 oz specialty jar for sampling or gifting. Pickled goods come in Regular (12 oz) and Large (16 oz). Not every flavor is offered in every size.","Jams come in Regular (8 oz) and Large (12 oz), plus a 4 oz specialty jar for sampling or gifting. Pickled goods come in Regular (12 oz) and Large (16 oz). Not every flavor is offered in every size."],["faq","/faq/","Do the pickles use the same jars?","Yes. Pickled vegetables wear the same Queen E label as the jams.","Yes. Pickled vegetables wear the same Queen E label as the jams."],["faq","/faq/","How long do jars keep?","Unopened, store them cool and dark for up to 18 months. After opening, refrigerate and enjoy within 4 to 6 weeks.","Unopened, store them cool and dark for up to 18 months. After opening, refrigerate and enjoy within 4 to 6 weeks."],["faq","/faq/","Do you ship?","Jars ship across the United States at USPS rates calculated from your ZIP code in the bag. Orders are made in small batches and take about 5 business days to prepare, plus USPS delivery time. You can also order online an","Jars ship across the United States at USPS rates calculated from your ZIP code in the bag. Orders are made in small batches and take about 5 business days to prepare, plus USPS delivery time. You can also order online and collect it at an upcoming event or pop-up we post, or find jars in store at Bayou Stuf in Lacombe, Louisiana."],["faq","/faq/","Do you have promo codes or sales?","Yes, from time to time. Current sales and promo codes are listed on the Deals page . Sales apply by themselves in your bag, and for a code you type it into the Promo code box in your bag and tap Apply.","Yes, from time to time. Current sales and promo codes are listed on the Deals page . Sales apply by themselves in your bag, and for a code you type it into the Promo code box in your bag and tap Apply."],["faq","/faq/","Can I book a jam making or etiquette class?","Yes. Queen E's hosts hands-on jam making and STEM labs and combined jam making and etiquette classes, and takes private group requests. See the Classes page for upcoming dates and to book and pay online.","Yes. Queen E's hosts hands-on jam making and STEM labs and combined jam making and etiquette classes, and takes private group requests. See the Classes page for upcoming dates and to book and pay online."],["faq","/faq/","What is J.U.D.A.H.?","It is Queen E's leadership curriculum for students and professionals, and it is also offered as a keynote.","It is Queen E's leadership curriculum for students and professionals, and it is also offered as a keynote."],["faq","/faq/","Can Queen E's come to my festival, market or event?","Yes. Use the Invite Queen E's page to tell us about your pop-up, festival, market or private event.","Yes. Use the Invite Queen E's page to tell us about your pop-up, festival, market or private event."],["faq","/faq/","Can I buy Queen E's jam wholesale to sell in my store or use in my restaurant?","Yes. Stores, restaurants and other businesses can buy Queen E's at a wholesale discount. Use the Wholesale page to choose the jars you would like and we will send you a quote to approve. Once you are an approved vendor, ","Yes. Stores, restaurants and other businesses can buy Queen E's at a wholesale discount. Use the Wholesale page to choose the jars you would like and we will send you a quote to approve. Once you are an approved vendor, you can reorder any time in the Wholesale Portal."],["faq","/faq/","How do stores carry Queen E's?","Use the Wholesale page to choose the jars you would like. Wholesale customers receive a discount on every jar, and we send you a quote to approve. Stores can also use the form on Locations.","Use the Wholesale page to choose the jars you would like. Wholesale customers receive a discount on every jar, and we send you a quote to approve. Stores can also use the form on Locations."],["faq","/faq/","How do I reorder as a current wholesale vendor?","Approved vendors can sign in to the Wholesale Portal with a code sent to their email, send a refill request and get an instant quote. LyKinda reviews it, adjusts quantities if needed and sets a drop-off date, then you ap","Approved vendors can sign in to the Wholesale Portal with a code sent to their email, send a refill request and get an instant quote. LyKinda reviews it, adjusts quantities if needed and sets a drop-off date, then you approve the final quote. You can pay by card online before the drop-off or by check at drop-off."],["faq","/faq/","Do wholesale orders include sales tax?","Stores that resell Queen E's jars need to give us a resale certificate. Businesses that use the product in a restaurant or service may be taxed differently. Ask us if you are not sure which applies.","Stores that resell Queen E's jars need to give us a resale certificate. Businesses that use the product in a restaurant or service may be taxed differently. Ask us if you are not sure which applies."],["page","/","Home","Queen E's Heirr: small-batch jams and pickled goods, STEM jam-making and etiquette classes, and the J.U.D.A.H. etiquette and leadership curriculum, from Slidell, Louisiana.","Crafted With Poise and a Little Joy. Taste, Science, and Leadership Boutique Confections Jam Making & STEM J.U.D.A.H. Build Leaders That Change the World"],["page","/invite/","Invite Queen E's to Your Event","Hosting a festival, market, church fair, or pop-up? Invite Queen E's Heirr to join your event in Slidell and beyond.","Invite Queen E's to Your Event Tell Us About Your Event"],["page","/judah/","J.U.D.A.H.","Leadership is not just a title. The J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Model book and curriculum from Queen E's Heirr, for professionals and leaders of student and community programs.","Leadership Is Not Just a Title. Leadership Is More Than a Title. Built for the People Who Lead People."],["page","/locations/","Locations","Where to find Queen E's Heirr jams and pickles, and how to ask your local store to carry them.","Where to Find the Jars Bayou Stuf Hosting an Event? Want Queen E's in Your Store?"],["page","/privacy-policy/","Privacy Policy","How Queen E's Heirr collects, uses, and protects your information.","Privacy Policy What We Collect How We Use It Who Else Handles It Cookies and Tracking Your Choices Changes Contact"],["page","/shop/","The Shop","Shop Queen E's small-batch jams and pickled goods. Mix any items in one bag and check out securely online.","The Shop"],["page","/stories/","Queen Talk","Queen Talk: stories, recipes, and etiquette notes from Queen E's Heirr.","Queen Talk Where the Jars Come From A Spoon, a Board, a Story"],["page","/teams/","Leadership Training for Teams and HR Leaders","Nationwide leadership training for teams, HR and people leaders, schools and organizations, built on the J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Model. Curriculum, workshops and keynote from Queen E's Heirr.","Leadership Training Your Team Will Remember Training and Resources for Your Organization J.U.D.A.H. for Professionals Executive Presence & Dining J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Keynote Student Programs Private Jam-Making Classes Books and Curriculum Built for the People Who Lead and Develop Others Why Queen E's Heirr How to Get Started Questions Leaders Ask Invest in the People You Lead"],["faq","/teams/","What leadership training does Queen E's Heirr offer for teams and companies?","Queen E's Heirr offers the J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Model and curriculum for professionals, an Executive Presence & Dining program, and a J.U.D.A.H. leadership keynote for schools and companies. The J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Mo","Queen E's Heirr offers the J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Model and curriculum for professionals, an Executive Presence & Dining program, and a J.U.D.A.H. leadership keynote for schools and companies. The J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Model book and curriculum resources are also available for leaders to use with their own teams."],["faq","/teams/","Who is the training for, and where do you serve?","Executive managers, HR and people leaders, nonprofit and community leaders, and the people who lead student and youth programs, including secular and faith-based organizations. We serve organizations nationwide.","Executive managers, HR and people leaders, nonprofit and community leaders, and the people who lead student and youth programs, including secular and faith-based organizations. We serve organizations nationwide."],["faq","/teams/","Can Queen E's speak at our company or school event?","Yes. The J.U.D.A.H. Leadership keynote presents the curriculum as a talk for schools, companies and organizations anywhere in the United States. Tell us about your event and audience and we will follow up.","Yes. The J.U.D.A.H. Leadership keynote presents the curriculum as a talk for schools, companies and organizations anywhere in the United States. Tell us about your event and audience and we will follow up."],["faq","/teams/","Do you offer team-building or private group sessions?","Yes. Queen E's takes private group requests for hands-on jam-making classes and combined jam-making and etiquette classes, which many groups use as a memorable team experience.","Yes. Queen E's takes private group requests for hands-on jam-making classes and combined jam-making and etiquette classes, which many groups use as a memorable team experience."],["faq","/teams/","How do I ask about a program for my organization?","Use the Ask About a Program form on the Etiquette & Leadership page, or the Invite Queen E's page for events, and share your group, goals and timing. We will recommend a fit.","Use the Ask About a Program form on the Etiquette & Leadership page, or the Invite Queen E's page for events, and share your group, goals and timing. We will recommend a fit."],["page","/terms-of-use/","Terms of Use","Terms of use and sale for queenesheirr.com.","Terms of Use and Sale Orders and Payment Shipping Damaged or Incorrect Orders Food Information Classes and Programs Website Content Governing Law Contact"],["page","/training/","Etiquette & Leadership","Etiquette and Leadership training for students, professionals, HR leaders, and faith-based organizations, built on the J.U.D.A.H. curriculum.","Etiquette, Leadership & J.U.D.A.H. For Students Youth Dining & Social Graces Student Leadership Academy J.U.D.A.H. for Students For Professionals Executive Presence & Dining J.U.D.A.H. for Professionals J.U.D.A.H. Leadership Keynote Ask About a Program"],["page","/wholesale/","Wholesale","Wholesale jams and pickled goods for retailers. Tell Queen E's Heirr about your shop and the cases you want.","Wholesale"]];
